<p>I gotta say, I liked it better when this had been stolen straight from the facility. Much more of a mysterious master thief vibe.</p>
<p>However, I understand that someone infiltrating the Foundation and stealing an SCP is unlikely.</p>
<p>I would respond with "that's the idea.", but that might not satisfy some of us. Regardless, I think that <em>well, we took it out on a mission and lost it</em> doesn't really do the object itself justice, since part of the intention of the theft was, as I understood it, to illustrate the strenngth of cumulative use of the SCP on its wearer. The break in did that better.</p>

